<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">United Nations</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The United Nations is an international organisation founded in 1945 to maintain peace and promote cooperation among states, with its headquarters in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-york">New York</a>. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hittite-empire">Hittite Empire</a> profile notes that a reproduction of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-kadesh">Egyptian–Hittite peace treaty</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kadesh">Kadesh</a> hangs at the United Nations headquarters. This reflects the treaty's status as one of the earliest recorded peace agreements.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/united-nations.jpg" alt="United Nations" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: See File history below for details. Denelson83, Zscout370 ve Madden · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_United_Nations.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
